WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:04.000
In Settings → Logging, session activity shows actions from this session.

00:00:04.000 --> 00:00:08.000
Turn on automatic saving to keep future entries in arcnix.log.

00:00:08.000 --> 00:00:12.000
Set the maximum size per file to 50 MiB.

00:00:12.000 --> 00:00:16.000
Keep five old log files when the current file fills up.

00:00:16.000 --> 00:00:19.000
Use Open local log to read the current file.
